      "items": [
        {
          "title": "路灯的颜色",
          "content": "<p>传统的路灯一般是<a href=\"https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2022-05-17/doc-imcwiwst7869042.shtml\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">高压纳灯</a>，发出黄光，所以很多文学作品和电影描绘城市的夜晚，都是“昏黄的路灯”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022071603.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>但是，现在的路灯纷纷替换成了更节能的 LED 灯，发出白光。因此，城市的夜晚不再发黄，而是变得“白亮”。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022071604.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>上图左侧是传统路灯的街道，右侧是 LED 路灯的街道。</p>\n<p>有报道称，电影公司对此很头痛。白光会让街道看上去更像白天，失去夜晚的氛围，因此不得不通过后期加工，将路灯改成黄光。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "路灯的颜色",
              "url": "https://nofilmschool.com/2014/02/why-hollywood-will-never-look-the-same-again-on-film-leds-in-la-ny"
            },
            {
              "text": "高压纳灯",
              "url": "https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2022-05-17/doc-imcwiwst7869042.shtml"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022071603.webp",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202207/bg2022071604.webp"
          ]
        },
